  "id": "testability",
  "term": "testability",
  "definition": "Testability is the extent to which a theory can be examined through experiments or observations that can distinguish its predictions from competing explanations. In this context, it means moving beyond verbal claims to specific, mechanistic ideas that can be checked empirically.",
